    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 14,
      "gh:layout": "full bleed -- Nei listens",
      "marginalia": [
        { "@type": "Philosophy", "en": "Buber + Levinas. The face of the Other. Anti-Havah moment.", "ja": "ブーバー＋レヴィナス。他者の顔。アンチ・ハヴァの瞬間。" }
      ],
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Close-up, Nei",
        "gh:visual": { "en": "Full page. Nei. Wings brighten. Particles scatter. She's listening. Never like this before.", "ja": "全面。Nei。翼が明るくなる。粒子が散る。聞いている。こんなふうには、一度も。" },
        "gh:neiCaption": [
          { "en": "No one has ever--", "ja": "誰も、今まで——" },
